  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xoianTtB/images/e14e98a05e84d1faac025782664331fde3bd0a66.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>這是一個客戶端整合包，大幅提升您在遊戲中的體驗。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">這意味著：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">您會獲得一個針對伺服器友善的手工調校整合包，內含接近原版的材質包和出色的陰影模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">搭配少量精心挑選的視覺與音效增強模組，確保不會影響效能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">而且由於這是客戶端整合包，您可以在任何伺服器上使用它。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>主要特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"> - 一款表現優異且高效能的陰影模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"> - Distant Horizons，預設設定即可搭配陰影模組使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"> - 預先混合的資源包，提供接近原版的優化體驗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"> - 平衡的視覺與生活便利度模組數量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"> - 完全僅限客戶端，讓您在喜歡的伺服器上暢玩無礙。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xoianTtB/images/ffe38152a81663b03e3bed731430f69a649d0183.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" /></p>",
